Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 15:33:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: amlogic: add VIM4 DRM display handoff profile

Select the fixed OSD1 handoff, read-only HDMI PLL and TX bridge, and split
VDIN resource ownership. Keep simple-framebuffer and the normal VPU
disabled, preserving both reserved firmware frames for a safe return.

Signed-off-by: localhost-copilot <318096335+localhost-copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
